  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"GJFZf\" id=\"GJFZf\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81de41b4\" id=\"u81de41b4\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">需求描述</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uea48bc74\" id=\"uea48bc74\"><span data-lake-id=\"u665b1fb0\" id=\"u665b1fb0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">目前我们开发的TCP服务端程序只能服务于一个客户端，如何开发一个多任务版的TCP服务端程序能够服务于多个客户端呢?</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u176f52bf\" id=\"u176f52bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64728d4d\" id=\"u64728d4d\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">完成多任务，可以使用</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u36ec2878\" id=\"u36ec2878\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">线程</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub3a26a1e\" id=\"ub3a26a1e\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">，比进程更加节省内存资源。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"SUQGr\" id=\"SUQGr\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75481ff9\" id=\"u75481ff9\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">实现步骤</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ucf105300\" id=\"ucf105300\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685189617054-1149ec5f-41a6-4c38-b61f-9846abd968c7.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc6e5a7e5-3422-4786-b0c9-acd7e5d08dd%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2f2fe5f6-10de-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1078%2C%22originHeight%22%3A417%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbfbfb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u958ee076%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"></card></p><ol list=\"u4efa051e\"><li fid=\"u6d4f2f74\" data-lake-id=\"u70c68649\" id=\"u70c68649\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ffa8da8\" id=\"u6ffa8da8\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">编写一个TCP服务端程序，循环等待接受客户端的连接请求</span></li><li fid=\"u6d4f2f74\" data-lake-id=\"u46621303\" id=\"u46621303\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0e439f64\" id=\"u0e439f64\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">当客户端和服务端建立连接成功，创建子线程，使用子线程专门处理客户端的请求，防止主线程阻塞</span></li><li fid=\"u6d4f2f74\" data-lake-id=\"ue9018c49\" id=\"ue9018c49\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaaaaaf67\" id=\"uaaaaaf67\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">把创建的子线程设置成为守护主线程，防止主线程无法退出，避免主线程结束时，子线程还在运行。</span></li></ol><h3 data-lake-id=\"pi83F\" id=\"pi83F\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3201cc04\" id=\"u3201cc04\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">示例代码</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E7%89%88TCP%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8.py%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20socket%5Cnimport%20threading%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%AB%AF%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%5Cndef%20handle_client_request(service_client_socket%2C%20ip_port)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20while%20True%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20recv_data%20%3D%20service_client_socket.recv(1024)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%9C%89%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8if%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E9%87%8C%E9%9D%A2%E6%9C%89%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%